Visual Studio Code in the browser, set up with your course's Python packages.
Files open from your home directory.

- Your course's packages are available in the integrated terminal. If they are
  missing, tell your teaching staff — the session still works without them.
- Claude Code and Codex are preinstalled. Sign in with your own account in a
  terminal.
- Extensions load without prompting for workspace trust.

Sessions usually start within a minute; a busy queue can take several.
